) An explosion near a bus station in Gombe, Nigeria, killed at least five people and injured over a dozen, reportedly caused by a suicide bomber who placed an explosives-laded bag near a bus.  
)  



) Although no group has claimed responsibility, Boko Haram is the main suspect, given its history of attacks on soft targets like bus stations.  
)  

) The attack marks the first since Nigeria's presidential election, which was won by Muhammadu Buhari, who has pledged to defeat Boko Haram.
